new.block.blockparallelcontroller.tooltips=§oWhen the machine controller's description contains "§9§oMax parallelism:§a§ox§7§o", it means this machine can overclock parallelism without loss.&n§oWhen at least one parallel controller is present in the structure, the machine parallels automatically.&n§oThe placement positions of parallel controllers are shown in the structure preview.
