new.block.manaliquefaction.tooltips=§a§oModified by §9§o[§6§oNEW§9§o]§a§o&n§aPress shift to view the new usage
new.block.manaliquefaction.tooltips.shift=§6Place a Mythic/Eternal Mana Pool above it to enable new modes&n§9Mythic:§6 When not redstone-powered, it fills the mana pool with mana as much as possible&n§6It will instantly convert as much internal liquid mana as possible into mana, and draw liquid mana into nearby fluid-storing containers&n§6When redstone-powered, it draws mana from the mana pool as much as possible&n§6It will instantly convert as much internal mana as possible into liquid mana, and output liquid mana to nearby fluid-storing containers&n§9Eternal:§6With a redstone signal, the Mana Liquefier's liquid mana and mana are refilled once per second&n§6Without a redstone signal, the Mana Liquefier's liquid mana and mana are emptied once per second
