new.item.map.bootes_star.tooltips=§fThe §aBoötes§f, observable only during the §bwaning crescent§f and §bwaxing crescent§f&n§fThe §ashepherd§f in the sky tirelessly tends to all living things.&nThe §bPhase Infuser requires this star chart to §anourish plants.
