new.item.map.fornax_star.tooltips=§fThe §6Fornax§f, observable only during the §bwaning gibbous§f and §bwaxing gibbous§f&n§fIt blooms with §6fiery§f brilliance behind the moon.&n§fThe §bPhase Refining Prism requires this star chart to harness the searing heat of §6Fornax.
