new.item.map.lyra_star.tooltips=§fThe §3Lyra§f, observable only during the §bfirst quarter§f and §bthird quarter§f&n§fLegend says the music of the §6lyre§f can soak into all things, even the tiniest particles.&n§fThe §bPhase Constructor§f requires this star chart to harness the power of §3Lyra.
new.item.map.monoceros_star.tooltips=§dMonoceros§f appears only during the §bnew moon.&n§fThe alert §dmonoceros§f roams the cosmos, taking in all §9celestial bodies§f.&n§fThe §dPhase§f Star-Pulling Tower requires this star chart to draw §8meteorites§f and §8meteoric iron§f from the §9boundless cosmos§f.
new.item.map.thunderbolt_star.tooltips=§fThe §eThunderbolt§f constellation, which appears only during the §bfull moon&n§fLegend says the power of the king of gods, §eZeus§f, is hidden within.&n§fThe §bStarlight Generator requires this star chart to locate §eThunderbolt.
