novaeng.space_generator.recipe.hxzk1.tooltips=§rDeploy the singularity to begin running the Phantom Matter Manipulation recipe&n§rThe recipe requires ore, fluid matter, and energy input&n§rThe ratio of fluid matter and energy to ore determines the final output ratio&n§rAt the end of each cycle, if the difference between the Crystalloid/electricity and ore unit ratios does not exceed §65%%§rthen the multiplier each can provide is §62§r, with a base value of §64§r, i.e. a maximum output of §616§r times&n§rEach deviation of §65%§r lowers the multiplier by §60.25§r; if the deviation exceeds §625%%§r, the recipe fails and the output is §60&n§rIf the corresponding singularity is present and there is enough of it, singularities are output first and then ingots; other recipes output ingots&n
